error[E0277]: `(i32, i32)` does not start with `String`, the parameters of the parent route
 --> tests/ui/fail/route_child_params.rs:6:39
  |
6 | const MEMBER: Route<(i32, i32)> = ORG.child("/orgs/{org}/members/{id}");
  |                                       ^^^^^ the trait `Extends<String>` is not implemented for `(i32, i32)`
  |
  = note: a child route's parameters repeat its parent's, in order, and may add more after them
  = help: the following other types implement trait `Extends<P>`:
            `()` implements `Extends<()>`
            `(A, B)` implements `Extends<()>`
            `(A, B)` implements `Extends<(A, B)>`
            `(A, B)` implements `Extends<A>`
            `(A, B, C)` implements `Extends<()>`
            `(A, B, C)` implements `Extends<(A, B)>`
            `(A, B, C)` implements `Extends<(A, B, C)>`
            `(A, B, C)` implements `Extends<A>`
          and $N others
note: required by a bound in `Route::<P, Q>::child`
 --> src/route.rs
